---
import Layout from "../layouts/main.astro";
---

<Layout title="Team" theme="dark">
  <section
    class="bg-black text-merino px-5 pt-10vh pb-[20vh] sm:px-5vh md:px-10vh"
  >
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-12 items-center justify-center">
      <h1 class="font-heading text-5xl sm:text-7xl text-center">Team</h1>
      <div class="bg-red h-0.5 w-[50vw] rounded-3xl"></div>
      <p class="font-body text-lg sm:text-xl px-0 lg:px-[15vw]">
        At the AIDS 2022 Conference in Montreal, LetsStopAIDS is the host
        organization of the YouthForce and is responsible for managing the
        creation and development of the Montreal YouthForce as well as the
        execution of its activities. LetsStopAIDS is pleased to partner with the
        International AIDS Society (IAS) for the AIDS 2022 Conference to promote
        youth involvement in the HIV response.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="bg-black text-merino px-5vw py-10vh">
    <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-6xl">Leadership Team</h2>
    <!-- splide -->
  </section>


</Layout>
